dsh-workspace-classifier v0.1.1
========================

MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 wyt.

The current version is an independent implementation: it leaves the shipped
`@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-workspace` browser in place and adds a grouping
layer over the native workspace list. It does not replace the
`sidebar.workspaces` slot.

An earlier prototype in this project was derived from `dsh-workspace-categories`
(MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 knight) and was replaced; no source from it remains in
the current `lib/client.js`. The MIT text is preserved in LICENSE.
